# Agreement between the European Union and the Republic of Latvia on EUPM Participation

```catala
declaration scope EUPM_Agreement:
  input initial_coverage_end_date content date
  input subsequent_coverage_start_date content date
  input min_service_duration content duration
  output annual_contribution content money
```

Article 2.1 specifies the minimum duration of service for seconded personnel.

```catala
scope EUPM_Agreement:
  date round down
  definition min_service_duration equals 1 year
```

Article 3.1 defines the periods during which personnel coverage is provided.

```catala
scope EUPM_Agreement:
  date round down
  definition end_date_initial equals initial_coverage_end_date
  definition start_date_subsequent equals subsequent_coverage_start_date
```

Article 6.1 sets the required annual financial contribution amount.

```catala
scope EUPM_Agreement:
  date round down
  definition annual_contribution equals 25000
```

Article 6.3 establishes the deadlines for communicating the total contribution amount.

```catala
scope EUPM_Agreement:
  date round down
  definition deadline_1 equals |2002-11-15|
  definition deadline_2 equals |2002-11-01|
```